  "description": "This is a quiz game where you answer elementary school-level math and science questions by choosing from four options.\n\n\"This one's obviously easy.\"\nThat's exactly when you're most at risk.\n\nArithmetic, units, and everyday natural phenomena —\nQuestions you think you know, but the answer just won't come.\n\n・Elementary-level questions leave no room to hide  \n・Four choices that rely on instinct can lead to unexpected mistakes  \n・Even adults may find themselves second-guessing their answers  \n\nWhen the results are in, you may start to wonder how much you really remember.\n\nGet ready for a fun and engaging challenge.\n\nA knowledge quiz game you can enjoy solo, with family and friends, or while streaming.\n\n———————————————\nTT supports gameplay streaming.\nNo permission from TT is required for gameplay streaming, whether personal or commercial.",
